OL,3,CUefa preparing 'criminal proceedings'
OL,4,Cagainst Fifa president Gianni Infantino
OL,6,FWords by ITV News Sports Producer Joe
OL,7,FWardropper
OL,9,FUefa is preparing "criminal
OL,10,Fproceedings" against Fifa president
OL,11,FGianni Infantino over his failed World
OL,12,FCup privatisation plan, according to
OL,13,Fcourt documents filed in the United
OL,14,FStates.
OL,16,FLawyers acting for Uefa said Fifa's
OL,17,Fattempt to sell off a 20% stake in the
OL,18,Ftournament at $4.2 billion (#3
OL,19,Fbillion) was an "absurdly low"
OL,20,Fvaluation.
OL,26,@qD@SOUrD@LO]{D@^O]
