OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1788626898
OL,3,CUefa preparing 'criminal proceedings'
OL,4,Cagainst Fifa president Gianni Infantino
OL,6,FThe papers, filed in a Florida court,
OL,7,Frequested documents from Fifa and
OL,8,Fother parties in order to test whether
OL,9,Fthe valuation amounted to "a
OL,10,Ffraudulently off-market price promoted
OL,11,Fby Infantino for his own benefit."
OL,13,FThe filings, seen by ITV News, said:
OL,14,F"UEFA and other interested parties are
OL,15,Fpreparing to bring criminal claims in
OL,16,FSwitzerland against Infantino and
OL,17,Fpossibly other FIFA officials and
OL,18,Fadvisors for criminal mismanagement
OL,19,Funder Article 158 of the Swiss
OL,20,FCriminal Code."
