OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1788626898
OL,3,CUefa preparing 'criminal proceedings'
OL,4,Cagainst Fifa president Gianni Infantino
OL,6,FThe threat of criminal action against
OL,7,Fthe Fifa president has amounted to an
OL,8,Fescalation in the civil war that has
OL,9,Fengulfed world football.
OL,11,FUefa's lawyers had already served
OL,12,FInfantino and other Fifa executives
OL,13,Fwith document preservation notices and
OL,14,Fwarned them of possible legal action.
OL,16,FInfantino faced immense backlash for
OL,17,Fhis plan to sell stakes in a World Cup
OL,18,Fcompany, named Fifa Forward Enterprise
OL,19,F(FFE), to private investors, with
OL,20,Fmultiple football bodies threatening
OL,21,Fto boycott the Fifa president.
